                <pb facs="0532" n="412" xml:id="pg412"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Señor Tejera to Señor
                            Joubert.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, [<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1905-12-19">undated</date>]. [<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Received December 29,
                    1905</hi>].</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#center">[Handed to Mr. Root December 30, 1905.]</p>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Joubert</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Washington:</hi></p>
                <p>Congress will accept treaty amended according to cable to Mr. Root December
                        7.<anchor n="a" xml:id="d372-f1"/> Executive approves. Caceres arrived
                    to-day.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Tejera.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
